  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">EU Twinning Migrationsverket EURODAC/EUROSUR fas 3</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU Twinning Swedish Migration Agency EURODAC/EUROSUR phase 3 - EU Twinning MiV EURODAC/SUR phase 3 KAPAME</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att st&#xf6;dja Migrationsverket i att n&#xe5; full kostnadst&#xe4;ckning f&#xf6;r deras arbete med att delta i genomf&#xf6;rande av EU-twinningprojekt.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Migrationsverket ans&#xf6;ker om st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r fas 3 (f&#xf6;rberedelser och genomf&#xf6;rande av missioner och studiebes&#xf6;k) inom ramen f&#xf6;r EU-twinningprojektet &quot;Support to preparation for participation in EUROSUR network and EURODAC system,  nr SR 16 IPA JH 03 19&quot;, d&#xe4;r Migrationsverket blir ledande och enda partner i projektet. F&#xf6;rm&#xe5;nslandets f&#xf6;rvaltning som &#xe4;r involverat i twinningprojektet &#xe4;r Inrikesministeriet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Migration Agency applies for support for full cost coverage in phase 3 (preparation and conduct of missions and study visits) within the framework of the EU twinning project &quot;Support to preparation for participation in the EUROSUR network and EURODAC system&quot;, no SR 16 IPA JH 03 19&quot;, where the Swedish Migration Agency will be the leading and only partner in the project. The beneficiary country&apos;s administration involved in the twinning project is the Ministry of the Interior.</narrative>
  </description>
